  "title": "Nicole's Winter Carrot Zucchini Bread",
  "description": "Applesauce and egg whites provide the moisture in Nicole's nutty, whole wheat winter zucchini-carrot bread recipe with cinnamon, nutmeg, and cloves.",
  "authors": [
